<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><font style="">The lead&nbsp; {!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} assigned to you with a lead stage of "TAL",&nbsp;</font><font style="">&nbsp;and Lead Status of “accepted” has eclipsed the maximum allowed SLA time with no initial task logged.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Click&nbsp;<a href="{!Lead.Link}">here</a><a href="https://intel.my.salesforce.com//p/email/template/EmailTemplateEditorUi/{!Lead.Link}" style="">&nbsp;</a>to visit this lead record in SFDC</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">As a reminder, the following SLA’s are expected for any TAL lead owned by you:&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; = Hot): Initial Task (Email or Phone Call) must be logged within 1 business day of Entrance Date&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; = Warm): Initial Task (Email or Phone Call) must be logged within 2 business days of Entrance Date&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">(&lt;Lead Priority&gt; = Cold):&nbsp; Initial Task (Email or Phone Call) must be logged within 4 business days of Entrance Date&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please disposition your lead by completing the required email or phone call task or mark the Lead Status as “disqualified” or “unreachable” as required.&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Thank you, please refer to&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/lead-management/">this document</a></span></font><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;if you have questions regarding how to manage any lead assigned to you or claimed by you.</span></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>